---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { getMeta } from '../lib/data';
import { formatDate } from '../lib/types';

const meta = getMeta();
---
<Layout
  title="About"
  description="GovAI Contracts is a free, independent index of federal AI/ML contract awards built from public USAspending.gov data."
>
  <h1>About GovAI Contracts</h1>
  <p class="lead">
    GovAI Contracts is a free, independent index of federal AI and machine-learning
    contract awards we can identify in the public record.
  </p>

  <h2>Where the data comes from</h2>
  <p>
    Award data comes from
    <a href="https://api.usaspending.gov/" rel="noopener" target="_blank">USAspending.gov</a>;
    open opportunities (pre-award RFPs and sources sought) come from
    <a href="https://sam.gov/data-services" rel="noopener" target="_blank">SAM.gov</a>.
    Both are in the public domain. We filter for AI-relevant NAICS codes
    (541511, 541512, 541513, 541519, 541715, 518210) and require an explicit
    AI/ML keyword match so the dataset stays focused.
  </p>

  <h2>How fresh is it?</h2>
  <p>
    The dataset rebuilds automatically every <strong>6 hours</strong> via a scheduled
    GitHub Actions cron. Last refresh:
    <strong>{formatDate(meta.generated_at)}</strong>.
  </p>

  <h2>Who is this for?</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Founders and BD teams</strong> looking for federal AI buyers.</li>
    <li><strong>Researchers and journalists</strong> tracking federal AI spend.</li>
    <li><strong>Vendors</strong> sizing up competitors and partner opportunities.</li>
    <li><strong>Policy folks</strong> watching how AI dollars actually flow.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>What's coming</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Email alerts for new contracts in your niche (<a href="/alerts/">join waitlist</a>).</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Free downloads</h2>
  <p>
    The full dataset is free and downloadable: <a href="/export/all.csv">CSV</a> · <a href="/export/all.json">JSON</a>.
    Per-agency, per-vendor, and per-NAICS exports are linked from each detail page.
  </p>

  <h2>License</h2>
  <p>
    Source code is <strong>MIT</strong>. The aggregated dataset is released under
    <a href="https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">CC0 1.0</a>
    — use it commercially without attribution. See the
    <a href="https://github.com/Nandanhegde1/govai-contracts/blob/main/LICENSE" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LICENSE file</a>
    for full terms.
  </p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>
    Questions, corrections, feature requests — open an issue on the
    <a href="https://github.com/Nandanhegde1/govai-contracts" rel="noopener" target="_blank">GitHub repo</a>.
  </p>

  <p class="meta" style="margin-top: 32px; color: var(--text-dim); font-size: 12px;">
    GovAI Contracts is an independent project and is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or
    connected to any U.S. government agency.
  </p>
</Layout>
